1
00:00:00,179 --> 00:00:02,126
1169 kroner ble til 899 kroner,

2
00:00:02,126 --> 00:00:04,137
men bare for en liten stund til.

3
00:00:04,137 --> 00:00:06,021
Akkurat nå koster den bare 899

4
00:00:06,021 --> 00:00:06,461
kroner.

5
00:00:06,461 --> 00:00:08,319
Ordinær pris er 1169 kroner.

6
00:00:08,319 --> 00:00:10,310
Dobbeltlinse, AI-sporing, 355

7
00:00:10,310 --> 00:00:11,409
graders dekning.

8
00:00:11,409 --> 00:00:13,744
Lageret er begrenset og prisen går

9
00:00:13,744 --> 00:00:14,430
opp snart.

10
00:00:14,430 --> 00:00:16,619
Handle i dag, betal med Klarna.

11
00:00:16,619 --> 00:00:18,174
Få den nå, betal senere.

12
00:00:18,174 --> 00:00:19,879
Fri frakt over 300 kroner.

13
00:00:19,879 --> 00:00:21,607
30 dagers åpent kjøp hvis du ikke

14
00:00:21,607 --> 00:00:22,183
er fornøyd.

15
00:00:22,183 --> 00:00:23,459
Ikke gå glipp av salget.

16
00:00:23,459 --> 00:00:25,467
Bestill før den er utsolgt
